		{"id":"394ab5cba24a0945","type":"text","text":"### Embedding input (Before)\n\nVena Solutions is a cloud-native FP&A platform that integrates seamlessly with Microsoft 365, focusing on collaborative budgeting, forecasting, and reporting. It utilizes a multi-dimensional model to support driver-based planning and scenario analysis, managing Actuals, Budgets, and Forecasts from ERP, CRM, and HR data. The platform's key data source, the General Ledger (GL), underpins financial reporting and analysis by maintaining detailed records of accounts and departmental allocations. Vena's AI-driven insights, powered by Vena Copilot, enhance decision-making for over 2,000 clients across various industries, including SaaS and healthcare, emphasizing the importance of Excel in financial planning.","x":-12040,"y":784,"width":560,"height":360},
		{"id":"cc4c949851d898ed","type":"text","text":"### Embedding input (After)\nVena Solutions, a leader in Financial Technology, offers a cloud-native FP&A platform integrated with Microsoft 365, facilitating collaborative budgeting, forecasting, and reporting. The platform utilizes a multi-dimensional model encompassing Accounts, Departments, Entities, Periods, and Scenarios, ensuring accuracy through 56 validation rules applied to the General Ledger (GL) source. The GL serves as the foundational data source for financial reporting, maintaining integrity across accounts and departmental allocations. Vena's AI-driven insights and automation enhance decision-making, making it essential for over 2,000 clients in various industries, including SaaS and Healthcare, to streamline their financial planning processes.","x":-11440,"y":784,"width":500,"height":360}
